# Applications — folder structure

Every project under `applications/` uses this layout. Shared application rules live only in root `.cursor/rules/`. Do not keep parallel copies under `applications/rules/`, `applications/.cursor/`, or `applications/{project}/.cursor/`.

## Required layout per project

`applications/{project}/`

1. **Project root** — **project-specific** build script(s) only (e.g. `build_{project}_docs.py`). Do **not** use a shared/generic application generator.
2. **`documents/`** — exactly three synced deliverables:
   - `{project}_pdf.pdf`
   - `{project}_ppt.pptx`
   - `{project}_word.docx`
   PowerPoint must meet [documents.mdc](documents.mdc).
3. **`rules/`** — call-specific rules only (typically `source_of_truth.mdc`). Scope with globs (`alwaysApply: false`).

## Opportunities (outside applications/)

`opportunities/` keeps its tracker, build script, and `rules/source_of_truth.mdc`. Scope with `globs: opportunities/**`.

## Shared rules (root `.cursor/rules/`)

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `folder_structure.mdc` | This layout |
| `documents.mdc` | Sync + elegant PowerPoint / cover standards |
| `instructions.mdc` | Writing style, .mdc word limit, deck quality pointer |

**Product SoT (not under `rules/`):** [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc) — includes the full Community Reach operating model.

## Assets & temp

- Prefer real photos from `assets/` (or a project `assets/` folder). Draw cascade story from the product SoT section 2.
- Final edited docs live only in `documents/`.
- Temporary build artifacts go in repo `tmp/` (gitignored).
